{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"不安重新出现，但不是怕眼前的亲近会松动，而是刚才那段充实的亲近时刻已经过去，眼前还没有新的满足接上；人有些无所依凭，也更清醒。\",\n      \"why\": \"前一刻他确实全然投入，也亲身感到时间正往前走；当那股欢喜退下，身体先失去支撑，随后才意识到舍不得，而记得那段充实并不能让眼前自动变得一样。\",\n      \"op\": \"保留\",\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"H\": [\n          \"H20\",\n          \"H21\"\n        ],\n        \"M\": [\n          \"M23\"\n        ],\n        \"orig\": [\n          1\n        ]\n      },\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S09-B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"刚才的热烈逐渐退去，他开始清楚地感到安静和空落。\",\n      \"why\": \"刚才那阵几乎忘了自己的快乐一度占据了他的全部心思；兴奋退下后，注意力重新回到身体，他才发现自己需要慢慢平复。空落来自这阵充分的欢喜已经过去，并不意味着先前的快乐不再真实。\",\n      \"op\": \"保留\",\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"H\": [\n          \"H15\",\n          \"H21\"\n        ],\n        \"M\": [\n          \"M41\"\n        ],\n        \"orig\": [\n          2\n        ]\n      },\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S09-B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"安静下来后，他像是在回味刚才那阵亲近与快乐留在自己心里的余响，不急着接上下一刻；心里仍绕着两个问题：刚才的快乐是真的吗，接下来又会怎样？\",\n      \"why\": \"他已经能够从一点距离感受亲近在自己身上留下了什么，也知道自己的满足不能替对方回答心意。因此，兴奋退去时，他可以先停在这份回味里，让未知继续悬着，而不必立刻追出答案。\",\n      \"op\": \"说清已有因果\",\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"H\": [\n          \"H12\",\n          \"H13\",\n          \"H21\"\n        ],\n        \"M\": [\n          \"M22\"\n        ],\n        \"orig\": []\n      },\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S09-B3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"他仍然不知道对方的心意，也清楚刚才的充实已经过去了，但不安暂时没有占满他的心思，开始感到这段亲近与快乐本身有一种超出自己愿望的美好。\",\n      \"why\": \"他已经能够在没有直接回应时，仍然带着自己的幸福安静地面对未知，也曾从一点距离感受亲近在自己身上留下的东西。现在兴奋退下，他不必立刻追着下一次满足或答案走，注意力便能暂时从自己想得到什么，转到这段经历本身。\",\n      \"op\": \"保留\",\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"H\": [\n          \"H12\",\n          \"H13\"\n        ],\n        \"M\": [],\n        \"orig\": [\n          3\n        ]\n      },\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S09-B4\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a93fb75d-8ca2-429e-9041-e743df17c632", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T184948080699Z", "elapsed_seconds": 210.781, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T18:53:18.872688+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c6648b4510e2204e5aa9c1b51d8f54da13a5f717b4d182494514de72e0887c47", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T184948080699Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "88d55adac38830b6a2f3bfb301c3c7091e036128fa3ec8aa0d5b3f92b31995e4"}}}
